  "canon:pmid": "SNOMED_ATT_PubTator3_context_32850046_causative-agent_0003308",
  "canon:title": "Substance use disorders: diagnosis and management for hospitalists.",
  "canon:abstract": "Substance use disorder is a significant health concern. Hospitalists manage patient with various forms of substance use disorder on a daily basis. In this review, we have tried to synthesize evidence together to give a brief, yet succinct, review of commonly encounters disorders; alcohol intoxication and withdrawal, opioid intoxication and withdrawal, cocaine intoxication and methamphetamine intoxication. We describe clinical features, diagnosis and management, which would serve as a great resource for hospitalist when managing these complicated patients.",
